# The admin UI is embedded in the worker as a committed build artifact, and CI
# fails the build when regenerating it produces a different file. The generator
# copies bytes straight out of the Vite output, so a source file checked out
# with CRLF — which is what git does on Windows under core.autocrlf — embeds
# CRLF and makes every Windows build disagree with every Linux one.
#
# Pinning the files the build reads keeps that artifact reproducible wherever
# it is built.
packages/admin-ui/index.html text eol=lf
packages/admin-ui/src/**/*.css text eol=lf
